{
  "title": "Namaz of Will",
  "data": "This prayer consists of two units and is offered between the Maghrib (sunset) and Isha’ (evening) obligatory prayers.\nIn the first unit, you may recite [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) (once) and [Surah al-Zalzalah](A103) thirteen times.\nIn the second unit, you may recite [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) (once) and [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) fifteen times.",
  "merits": "This prayer was advised by the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.). Whoever offers this prayer regularly every evening, will win innumerable rewards."
}
